  Notation ST4 pc mm n x5 x11 x12 x17 :=
    (MS (mkR x1 (Z_to_bv 64 SPA) gp tp x5 x6 (Z_to_bv 64 WK) (Z_to_bv 64 SP) (Z_to_bv 64 SPA) (Z_to_bv 64 n) x11 x12
